## Original Content
<p style="text-indent: 2em;">当日，联合国环境规划署驻华代表处在北京举办2025年世界环境日主题活动，邀请来自联合国机构、政府部门、相关企业与机构的嘉宾，探讨交流治理塑料污染的政策与实践。</p> <p style="text-indent: 2em;">6月5日是世界环境日。据介绍，今年的世界环境日将重点关注塑料污染带来的影响，推动全球形成“拒绝、减少、再利用、回收、反思”的塑料治理共识。</p>

## Summary
The 2025 World Environment Day event in Beijing, organized by the United Nations Environment Programme, focused on plastic pollution management. Stakeholders from various sectors discussed policies and practices to promote a global consensus on reducing, reusing, and recycling plastics.

## Key Points
- Event organized by UNEP in Beijing for World Environment Day 2025.
- Main theme is plastic pollution, with discussions on policies and practices.
- Promotion of 'refuse, reduce, reuse, recycle, rethink' approach for plastic management.
- Participation from UN agencies, governments, enterprises, and organizations.
- World Environment Day is on June 5th, emphasizing environmental awareness.


